      "id": "2026_高長_Q06",
      "paperId": "2026_高長_(重點轉化)",
      "questionNumber": 6,
      "stem": "A 58-year-old female with primary membranous nephropathy presents with acute left flank pain, gross hematuria, and a sudden decline in renal function. Doppler ultrasonography confirms acute renal vein thrombosis (RVT). Her serum Albumin is 1.8 g/dL. Which of the following statements regarding risk factors and therapeutic management for RVT in this patient is CORRECT?",
      "options": [
        "A. Serum Albumin levels below 3.5 g/dL carry no clinical predictive value for RVT, and therapeutic anticoagulation is contraindicated due to bleeding risk.",
        "B. Serum Albumin below 2.0–2.5 g/dL is a strong predictor of RVT, and immediate systemic anticoagulation (such as LMWH or UFH followed by oral anticoagulants) is indicated.",
        "C. RVT in membranous nephropathy should be managed solely with high-dose corticosteroid monotherapy without anticoagulation.",
        "D. Systemic anticoagulation should be limited to 48 hours maximum regardless of ongoing nephrotic-range proteinuria or serum Albumin levels."
      ],
      "sourceProvidedAnswer": "B",
      "sourceAnswerStatus": "synthetic_tonks",
      "sourceExplanation": "【選項分析】\nA. 【錯誤】Serum Albumin 程度為評估 RVT 風險的核心指標。當 Serum Albumin 低於 2.0–2.5 g/dL 時，RVT 及其他 Thromboembolic Events 的風險顯著攀升，確認血栓存在時應積極進行 Therapeutic Anticoagulation。\nB. 【正確】Serum Albumin 低於 2.0–2.5 g/dL 是 Membranous Nephropathy 患者發生 RVT 的強烈獨立預測因子。一旦確診急性 RVT，應立即啟動 Systemic Anticoagulation（初次給予 LMWH 或 UFH，隨後銜接 Oral Anticoagulants 如 Warfarin 或 DOACs），療程通常維持 3–6 個月或直到 Nephrotic Syndrome 與 Severe Hypoalbuminemia 緩解。\nC. 【錯誤】High-dose Corticosteroid Monotherapy 僅用於抑制底層免疫病變，無法替代 Anticoagulation 來溶解或防止血栓擴散；確診 RVT 必須投予系統性抗凝血藥物。\nD. 【錯誤】RVT 的 Anticoagulation 療程至少需要維持 3–6 個月，且若患者持續處於 Nephrotic Range Proteinuria 及極低 Serum Albumin 狀態，抗凝治療需持續進行，絕不能僅限於 48 小時。",
