      "id": "2026_高長_Q11",
      "paperId": "2026_高長_(重點轉化)",
      "questionNumber": 11,
      "stem": "A renal biopsy is performed on a 62-year-old man with a 20-year history of poorly controlled type 2 diabetes mellitus, nephrotic-range proteinuria (6.5 g/day), and progressive renal insufficiency. Light microscopy reveals diffuse glomerular basement membrane (GBM) thickening, mesangial matrix expansion, and nodular glomerulosclerosis (Kimmelstiel-Wilson nodules). Immunofluorescence (IF) microscopy demonstrates diffuse, smooth linear staining along the capillary loops for IgG, Albumin, and C3. Electron microscopy shows no electron-dense immune complex deposits. Which mechanism best accounts for the linear immunofluorescence staining pattern in this patient?",
      "options": [
        "A. Pathogenic autoantibodies targeting the non-collagenous domain 1 of the α3 chain of type IV collagen [α3(IV)NC1]",
        "B. Non-specific adsorption and passive trapping of plasma proteins onto glycated and thickened basement membrane matrix",
        "C. Subepithelial deposition of in situ immune complexes against phospholipase A2 receptor (PLA2R)",
        "D. Monoclonal light chain deposition forming organized non-branching fibrils within the mesangium"
      ],
      "sourceProvidedAnswer": "B",
      "sourceAnswerStatus": "synthetic_tonks",
      "sourceExplanation": "在晚期 Diabetic nephropathy 中，Renal biopsy 可見 Diffuse GBM thickening、Mesangial expansion、Arteriolar hyalinosis 以及 Kimmelstiel-Wilson nodules。由於 GBM 結構改變、Glycation 以及基底膜增厚，血漿中的蛋白會發生非特異性吸附與被動陷留（Non-specific adsorption and passive trapping of plasma proteins）。因此在 Immunofluorescence (IF) 下，會呈現對 Albumin、IgG 及 C3 的 Diffuse linear staining。這種現象稱為 Pseudo-linear IF staining，並不代表 Autoantibody-mediated disease 或 Anti-GBM disease。Electron microscopy (EM) 下亦無真正的 Subendothelial / Subepithelial immune complex deposits。\n\n- Option A 錯誤：Targeting α3(IV)NC1 domain 是真正的 Anti-GBM disease (Goodpasture syndrome) 的病理機制，其 Linear IgG staining 為致病性 Autoantibodies 結合，且 IF 不會同時出現強烈的 Albumin 非特異性陷留。\n- Option C 錯誤：PLA2R autoantibodies 為 Membranous nephropathy 的特徵，IF 呈現 Granular pattern，非 Linear pattern。\n- Option D 錯誤：此描述為 Fibrillary glomerulonephritis 或 Light-chain deposition disease (LCDD)，非 Diabetic nephropathy 之非特異性線性吸附。",
